430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 780 0 R
/ActualText (Our program's domestic violence and sexual assault response efforts focus on ensuring equitable access to care and support for survivors from all communities. We recognize that our systems of response have a disparate impact on our community that contribute to disparities in health outcomes, and we work to address these disparities through system-wide coordination, training and technical assistance, and the development of survivor-centered policy recommendations. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
